t i am making one  since the news has been broken about the  jon snow development yes there is a jon  snow show in development the hollywood  reporter story was largely correct and i  would expect no less from james hibbard  i have dealt with a lot of reporters  over the years and hibbard is one of the  very best an actual journalist who does  all the things journalists should do  getting the facts right talking to  sources respecting requests for  background only and off the record that  most of the clickbait sites never bother  with as of right now our working title  for the show is snow  there are four live-action successor  shows in development at hbo word got out  about three of them a while ago i think  some of these were officially announced  these things always seem to leak there  are so many involved like writers agents  and everyone has assistants and there's  always the guy who runs the xerox  machine and reporters have sources so  snow has been in development almost as  long as the other three but for whatever  reason it was never announced and it  never leaked until now  but yes it is real this was not an  official announcement from hbo so it  seems there was another leak i did a  long interview with james ebert last  week for the big house of the dragon  story for the hollywood reporter at the  end of the interview he asked a few  questions about the successor shows  james hibbard wanted to know if one of  them was a sequel i answered no comment  then he asked is there a member of the  original show that is involved and i  again answered no comment and that was  all but he found someone more  forthcoming than me  who i don't know and i suspect i never  will a good journalist never reveals his  sources  there's not much more i can say right  now not until hbo gives me a green light  it seems as though amelia clark has  already mentioned that snow was kit's  idea in a recent interview so that is  already out yes it was kit harrington  who brought the idea to us i cannot tell  you the names of the writers and  showrunners since that has not been  cleared for the release yet however kit  did bring them in too his own team and  they are terrific  various rumors are floating around about  my involvement or lack of the same i am  involved just as i am with the hedge  knight the sea snake and ten thousand  ships and all the animated shows kit's  team has visited me here at my home in  santa fe and worked with me and my own  team of brilliant talented writers and  consultants to hammer out the show all  four of these successor shows are still  in the script stage outline and  treatments have been written and  approved scripts have been written notes  have been given second and third drafts  have been written as well  so far that's all that is the way tv  works don't forget nothing has been  greenlit yet and there is no guarantee  when or if it will be or any of these  shows the likelihood of all four shows  getting on the air well i'd love it but  that's not the way it works usually  there's all sorts of reasons pilots  never get brought up the series all  sorts of reasons scripts never get shot  all sorts of reasons great treatments  never get sent to script that's the way  the business works this is a new day  though so here is hoping one or two or  three or all four of the game of thrones  successor shows make it on the air  that's all i can say about snow just now  if hbo says i can say more then i will  well there you have it folks the jon  snow series has now been confirmed by  george rr martin himself and i must say  all of this new information he shared is  insane i was not expecting all of this  whatsoever the fact that george rr  martin likes this idea and is also  working on the show says a lot he  obviously isn't bothered by the fact  that hbo wants to show what is happening  with john even after george rr martin's  ending i'm assuming they must have some  really great ideas in mind for where jon  snow could go in the future this also  makes me think kid harrington was not  happy with how jon snow's story ended i  feel like he has some void he wants to  fill by showing what jon snow will  really do after daenerys is dead and  brain stark is now the new king  as i've said in other videos there are  all kinds of different things they could  have this character do i won't get into  all of that here again  most of you already know some of my  ideas if you saw my version of game of  thrones season 9.  now since i've already made one video  and released it earlier today i don't  want to spend too much more time on this  one i just had to fill you in on the new  details because this story is getting  more and more exciting each day  the fact that they have also been  working on this show since some of the  other successor shows were brought  george's way is interesting as well they  are most likely much further along in  the developmental stages on this show  than we originally thought i don't know  about all of you but i'm getting very  excited for the show i hope hbo gives  this the green light i want to see this  more than i do house of the dragon as  i'm sure some of you already know i've  always been a bigger fan of house stark  than i was of house targaryen  not only that but i've always wanted a  show about the north and its mysteries  although i don't know what this show  will actually be about i guess we will  just have to wait and see what happens  either way i'm very excited and ready  for more  let me know how all of you feel about  this information leave your thoughts  down below  as always i want to thank everyone for  watching another video i hope you all  have a great day i'll see you soon bye  [Music]  [Music]  so  so  you

